<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 6-month t-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 6-month t-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday six-month bills with Wednesday settlement.</p>
<p>The treasury had last auctioned 3.05 trillion lira worth two-year inflation-indexed coupon bonds on June 17.</p>
<p>The central bank has 24.5 trillion lira of reverse repo repayment on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : December 24, 1997</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: June 24, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : June 25, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
